{"id":"e7e5809ad6a0a5e0","group":"FormalSystem","path":"FormalSystem/172_AC⁰-Frege_系统.md","title":"172 AC⁰-Frege 系统","display":"172_AC⁰-Frege_系统","type":"system","metadata":{},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[],"html":"<p><span class=\"inline-tag\">#FormalSystem</span></p>\n<h1 id=\"172.-$AC^0$-Frege-系统\">172. <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"AC^0\">\\(AC^0\\)</span>-Frege 系统</h1>\n<h1 id=\"1.-原始符号\">1. 原始符号</h1>\n<p>命题变量集为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{PVar}=\\{p_0,p_1,\\ldots\\}\">\\(\\mathsf{PVar}=\\{p_0,p_1,\\ldots\\}\\)</span>。门标记集为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Gate}_{AC^0}\n=\n\\{\\top,\\bot,\\operatorname{var},\\operatorname{neg},\\operatorname{imp}\\}\n\\cup\\{\\operatorname{and}_m,\\operatorname{or}_m:m\\ge1\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Gate}_{AC^0}\n=\n\\{\\top,\\bot,\\operatorname{var},\\operatorname{neg},\\operatorname{imp}\\}\n\\cup\\{\\operatorname{and}_m,\\operatorname{or}_m:m\\ge1\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"AC^0\">\\(AC^0\\)</span>-Frege 公式使用以下构造符：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\top,\\bot,\\operatorname{var},\\operatorname{neg},\\operatorname{imp},\n\\operatorname{and}_m,\\operatorname{or}_m\\quad(m\\ge1).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\top,\\bot,\\operatorname{var},\\operatorname{neg},\\operatorname{imp},\n\\operatorname{and}_m,\\operatorname{or}_m\\quad(m\\ge1).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{and}_m\">\\(\\operatorname{and}_m\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{or}_m\">\\(\\operatorname{or}_m\\)</span> 是无界扇入门构造符；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"m\">\\(m\\)</span> 是构造符的元索引，不是对象语言项。显示记号为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\neg A\">\\(\\neg A\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\to B\">\\(A\\to B\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\bigwedge_{j&lt;m}A_j\">\\(\\bigwedge_{j&lt;m}A_j\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\bigvee_{j&lt;m}A_j\">\\(\\bigvee_{j&lt;m}A_j\\)</span>。</p>\n<p>门 arity 函数满足</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{arity}_{AC^0}:\\mathsf{Gate}_{AC^0}\\to\\mathbb N,\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{arity}_{AC^0}:\\mathsf{Gate}_{AC^0}\\to\\mathbb N,\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>并且</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{arity}_{AC^0}(\\top)=\\operatorname{arity}_{AC^0}(\\bot)=0,\\quad\n\\operatorname{arity}_{AC^0}(\\operatorname{var})=1,\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{arity}_{AC^0}(\\top)=\\operatorname{arity}_{AC^0}(\\bot)=0,\\quad\n\\operatorname{arity}_{AC^0}(\\operatorname{var})=1,\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{arity}_{AC^0}(\\operatorname{neg})=1,\\quad\n\\operatorname{arity}_{AC^0}(\\operatorname{imp})=2,\\quad\n\\operatorname{arity}_{AC^0}(\\operatorname{and}_m)=\n\\operatorname{arity}_{AC^0}(\\operatorname{or}_m)=m.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{arity}_{AC^0}(\\operatorname{neg})=1,\\quad\n\\operatorname{arity}_{AC^0}(\\operatorname{imp})=2,\\quad\n\\operatorname{arity}_{AC^0}(\\operatorname{and}_m)=\n\\operatorname{arity}_{AC^0}(\\operatorname{or}_m)=m.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"2.-公式、大小与深度\">2. 公式、大小与深度</h1>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Frm}_{AC^0}\">\\(\\mathsf{Frm}_{AC^0}\\)</span> 是满足以下条件的最小集合：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\top,\\bot\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{AC^0}\">\\(\\top,\\bot\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{AC^0}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p\\in\\mathsf{PVar}\">\\(p\\in\\mathsf{PVar}\\)</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{var}(p)\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{AC^0}\">\\(\\operatorname{var}(p)\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{AC^0}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{AC^0}\">\\(A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{AC^0}\\)</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{neg}(A)\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{AC^0}\">\\(\\operatorname{neg}(A)\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{AC^0}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{AC^0}\">\\(A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{AC^0}\\)</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{imp}(A,B)\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{AC^0}\">\\(\\operatorname{imp}(A,B)\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{AC^0}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"m\\ge1\">\\(m\\ge1\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A_0,\\ldots,A_{m-1}\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{AC^0}\">\\(A_0,\\ldots,A_{m-1}\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{AC^0}\\)</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{and}_m(A_0,\\ldots,A_{m-1})\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{AC^0}\">\\(\\operatorname{and}_m(A_0,\\ldots,A_{m-1})\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{AC^0}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>在相同条件下，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{or}_m(A_0,\\ldots,A_{m-1})\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{AC^0}\">\\(\\operatorname{or}_m(A_0,\\ldots,A_{m-1})\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{AC^0}\\)</span>。</li>\n</ol>\n<p>大小函数与深度函数的类型为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{size},\\operatorname{depth}:\\mathsf{Frm}_{AC^0}\\to\\mathbb N.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{size},\\operatorname{depth}:\\mathsf{Frm}_{AC^0}\\to\\mathbb N.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>大小函数由下列子句定义：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{size}(\\top)=\\operatorname{size}(\\bot)=1,\n\\qquad\n\\operatorname{size}(\\operatorname{var}(p))=1,\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{size}(\\top)=\\operatorname{size}(\\bot)=1,\n\\qquad\n\\operatorname{size}(\\operatorname{var}(p))=1,\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{size}(\\neg A)=1+\\operatorname{size}(A),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{size}(\\neg A)=1+\\operatorname{size}(A),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{size}(A\\to B)=1+\\operatorname{size}(A)+\\operatorname{size}(B),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{size}(A\\to B)=1+\\operatorname{size}(A)+\\operatorname{size}(B),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{size}\\!\\left(\\bigwedge_{j&lt;m}A_j\\right)\n=\n\\operatorname{size}\\!\\left(\\bigvee_{j&lt;m}A_j\\right)\n=1+\\sum_{j&lt;m}\\operatorname{size}(A_j).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{size}\\!\\left(\\bigwedge_{j&lt;m}A_j\\right)\n=\n\\operatorname{size}\\!\\left(\\bigvee_{j&lt;m}A_j\\right)\n=1+\\sum_{j&lt;m}\\operatorname{size}(A_j).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>深度函数由下列子句定义：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{depth}(\\top)=\\operatorname{depth}(\\bot)=0,\n\\qquad\n\\operatorname{depth}(\\operatorname{var}(p))=0,\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{depth}(\\top)=\\operatorname{depth}(\\bot)=0,\n\\qquad\n\\operatorname{depth}(\\operatorname{var}(p))=0,\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{depth}(\\neg A)=1+\\operatorname{depth}(A),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{depth}(\\neg A)=1+\\operatorname{depth}(A),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{depth}(A\\to B)\n=1+\\max\\{\\operatorname{depth}(A),\\operatorname{depth}(B)\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{depth}(A\\to B)\n=1+\\max\\{\\operatorname{depth}(A),\\operatorname{depth}(B)\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{depth}\\!\\left(\\bigwedge_{j&lt;m}A_j\\right)\n=\n\\operatorname{depth}\\!\\left(\\bigvee_{j&lt;m}A_j\\right)\n=1+\\max_{j&lt;m}\\operatorname{depth}(A_j).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{depth}\\!\\left(\\bigwedge_{j&lt;m}A_j\\right)\n=\n\\operatorname{depth}\\!\\left(\\bigvee_{j&lt;m}A_j\\right)\n=1+\\max_{j&lt;m}\\operatorname{depth}(A_j).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"d\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(d\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span> 定义常深度行类</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{AC^0Line}_d=\\{\\,A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{AC^0}\\mid \\operatorname{depth}(A)\\le d\\,\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{AC^0Line}_d=\\{\\,A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{AC^0}\\mid \\operatorname{depth}(A)\\le d\\,\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"AC^0\">\\(AC^0\\)</span>-Frege 证明对象必须在同一个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"d\">\\(d\\)</span> 下逐行检查。</p>\n<h1 id=\"3.-变量、代换与上下文\">3. 变量、代换与上下文</h1>\n<p>自由变量函数 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{FV}:\\mathsf{Frm}_{AC^0}\\to\\mathcal P(\\mathsf{PVar})\">\\(\\mathrm{FV}:\\mathsf{Frm}_{AC^0}\\to\\mathcal P(\\mathsf{PVar})\\)</span> 由以下子句给出：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{FV}(\\top)=\\mathrm{FV}(\\bot)=\\varnothing,\\qquad\n\\mathrm{FV}(\\operatorname{var}(p))=\\{p\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{FV}(\\top)=\\mathrm{FV}(\\bot)=\\varnothing,\\qquad\n\\mathrm{FV}(\\operatorname{var}(p))=\\{p\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{FV}(\\neg A)=\\mathrm{FV}(A),\\qquad\n\\mathrm{FV}(A\\to B)=\\mathrm{FV}(A)\\cup\\mathrm{FV}(B),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{FV}(\\neg A)=\\mathrm{FV}(A),\\qquad\n\\mathrm{FV}(A\\to B)=\\mathrm{FV}(A)\\cup\\mathrm{FV}(B),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{FV}\\!\\left(\\bigwedge_{j&lt;m}A_j\\right)=\\bigcup_{j&lt;m}\\mathrm{FV}(A_j),\\qquad\n\\mathrm{FV}\\!\\left(\\bigvee_{j&lt;m}A_j\\right)=\\bigcup_{j&lt;m}\\mathrm{FV}(A_j).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{FV}\\!\\left(\\bigwedge_{j&lt;m}A_j\\right)=\\bigcup_{j&lt;m}\\mathrm{FV}(A_j),\\qquad\n\\mathrm{FV}\\!\\left(\\bigvee_{j&lt;m}A_j\\right)=\\bigcup_{j&lt;m}\\mathrm{FV}(A_j).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>本语言没有绑定构造。定义</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{BV}_{AC^0}:\\mathsf{Frm}_{AC^0}\\to\\mathcal P(\\mathsf{PVar}),\n\\qquad\n\\operatorname{BV}_{AC^0}(A)=\\varnothing.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{BV}_{AC^0}:\\mathsf{Frm}_{AC^0}\\to\\mathcal P(\\mathsf{PVar}),\n\\qquad\n\\operatorname{BV}_{AC^0}(A)=\\varnothing.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>一个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"AC^0\">\\(AC^0\\)</span>-代换是函数 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\sigma:\\mathsf{PVar}\\to\\mathsf{Frm}_{AC^0}\">\\(\\sigma:\\mathsf{PVar}\\to\\mathsf{Frm}_{AC^0}\\)</span>。其扩张</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Sub}_{AC^0}(\\sigma,-)=\\widehat\\sigma:\n\\mathsf{Frm}_{AC^0}\\to\\mathsf{Frm}_{AC^0}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Sub}_{AC^0}(\\sigma,-)=\\widehat\\sigma:\n\\mathsf{Frm}_{AC^0}\\to\\mathsf{Frm}_{AC^0}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>由下列全部子句定义：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\widehat\\sigma(\\top)=\\top,\\quad\n\\widehat\\sigma(\\bot)=\\bot,\\quad\n\\widehat\\sigma(\\operatorname{var}(p))=\\sigma(p),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\widehat\\sigma(\\top)=\\top,\\quad\n\\widehat\\sigma(\\bot)=\\bot,\\quad\n\\widehat\\sigma(\\operatorname{var}(p))=\\sigma(p),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\widehat\\sigma(\\neg A)=\\neg\\widehat\\sigma(A),\\quad\n\\widehat\\sigma(A\\to B)=\\widehat\\sigma(A)\\to\\widehat\\sigma(B),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\widehat\\sigma(\\neg A)=\\neg\\widehat\\sigma(A),\\quad\n\\widehat\\sigma(A\\to B)=\\widehat\\sigma(A)\\to\\widehat\\sigma(B),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\widehat\\sigma\\!\\left(\\bigwedge_{j&lt;m}A_j\\right)=\n\\bigwedge_{j&lt;m}\\widehat\\sigma(A_j),\\qquad\n\\widehat\\sigma\\!\\left(\\bigvee_{j&lt;m}A_j\\right)=\n\\bigvee_{j&lt;m}\\widehat\\sigma(A_j).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\widehat\\sigma\\!\\left(\\bigwedge_{j&lt;m}A_j\\right)=\n\\bigwedge_{j&lt;m}\\widehat\\sigma(A_j),\\qquad\n\\widehat\\sigma\\!\\left(\\bigvee_{j&lt;m}A_j\\right)=\n\\bigvee_{j&lt;m}\\widehat\\sigma(A_j).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>对 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p,q\\in\\mathsf{PVar}\">\\(p,q\\in\\mathsf{PVar}\\)</span>，令 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\rho_{p,q}:\\mathsf{PVar}\\to\\mathsf{Frm}_{AC^0}\">\\(\\rho_{p,q}:\\mathsf{PVar}\\to\\mathsf{Frm}_{AC^0}\\)</span> 满足</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\rho_{p,q}(r)=\n\\begin{cases}\n\\operatorname{var}(q),&amp;r=p,\\\\\n\\operatorname{var}(r),&amp;r\\ne p.\n\\end{cases}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\rho_{p,q}(r)=\n\\begin{cases}\n\\operatorname{var}(q),&amp;r=p,\\\\\n\\operatorname{var}(r),&amp;r\\ne p.\n\\end{cases}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>定义</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FreeRen}_{AC^0}(A,p,q)=\\widehat\\rho_{p,q}(A),\n\\qquad\n\\operatorname{BoundRen}_{AC^0}(A,p,q)=A,\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{FreeRen}_{AC^0}(A,p,q)=\\widehat\\rho_{p,q}(A),\n\\qquad\n\\operatorname{BoundRen}_{AC^0}(A,p,q)=A,\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>以及</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"A\\equiv_{\\alpha,AC^0}B\\Longleftrightarrow A=B.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[A\\equiv_{\\alpha,AC^0}B\\Longleftrightarrow A=B.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>这里 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{BoundRen}_{AC^0}\">\\(\\operatorname{BoundRen}_{AC^0}\\)</span> 是无绑定语言上的恒等操作。派生双条件定义为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"A\\leftrightarrow B:=(A\\to B)\\land(B\\to A),\n\\qquad\nA\\land B:=\\operatorname{and}_2(A,B).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[A\\leftrightarrow B:=(A\\to B)\\land(B\\to A),\n\\qquad\nA\\land B:=\\operatorname{and}_2(A,B).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>单孔上下文 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ctx}_{AC^0}\">\\(\\mathsf{Ctx}_{AC^0}\\)</span> 是满足下列形成子句的最小集合：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Box\\in\\mathsf{Ctx}_{AC^0}\">\\(\\Box\\in\\mathsf{Ctx}_{AC^0}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C\\in\\mathsf{Ctx}_{AC^0}\">\\(C\\in\\mathsf{Ctx}_{AC^0}\\)</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\neg C\\in\\mathsf{Ctx}_{AC^0}\">\\(\\neg C\\in\\mathsf{Ctx}_{AC^0}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C\\in\\mathsf{Ctx}_{AC^0}\">\\(C\\in\\mathsf{Ctx}_{AC^0}\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{AC^0}\">\\(B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{AC^0}\\)</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C\\to B\">\\(C\\to B\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B\\to C\">\\(B\\to C\\)</span> 属于 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ctx}_{AC^0}\">\\(\\mathsf{Ctx}_{AC^0}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"m\\ge1\">\\(m\\ge1\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k&lt;m\">\\(k&lt;m\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C\\in\\mathsf{Ctx}_{AC^0}\">\\(C\\in\\mathsf{Ctx}_{AC^0}\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B_i\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{AC^0}\">\\(B_i\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{AC^0}\\)</span> 对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"i&lt;m, i\\ne k\">\\(i&lt;m, i\\ne k\\)</span> 成立，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\bigwedge_{i&lt;m}D_i\\in\\mathsf{Ctx}_{AC^0}\">\\(\\bigwedge_{i&lt;m}D_i\\in\\mathsf{Ctx}_{AC^0}\\)</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"D_k=C\">\\(D_k=C\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"D_i=B_i\">\\(D_i=B_i\\)</span> 对 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"i\\ne k\">\\(i\\ne k\\)</span> 成立。</li>\n<li>在相同条件下，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\bigvee_{i&lt;m}D_i\\in\\mathsf{Ctx}_{AC^0}\">\\(\\bigvee_{i&lt;m}D_i\\in\\mathsf{Ctx}_{AC^0}\\)</span>。</li>\n</ol>\n<p>填充函数</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{fill}_{AC^0}:\\mathsf{Ctx}_{AC^0}\\times\\mathsf{Frm}_{AC^0}\\to\\mathsf{Frm}_{AC^0}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{fill}_{AC^0}:\\mathsf{Ctx}_{AC^0}\\times\\mathsf{Frm}_{AC^0}\\to\\mathsf{Frm}_{AC^0}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>由下列全部子句定义：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{fill}_{AC^0}(\\Box,A)=A,\\quad\n\\operatorname{fill}_{AC^0}(\\neg C,A)=\\neg\\operatorname{fill}_{AC^0}(C,A),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{fill}_{AC^0}(\\Box,A)=A,\\quad\n\\operatorname{fill}_{AC^0}(\\neg C,A)=\\neg\\operatorname{fill}_{AC^0}(C,A),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{fill}_{AC^0}(C\\to B,A)=\\operatorname{fill}_{AC^0}(C,A)\\to B,\\quad\n\\operatorname{fill}_{AC^0}(B\\to C,A)=B\\to\\operatorname{fill}_{AC^0}(C,A),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{fill}_{AC^0}(C\\to B,A)=\\operatorname{fill}_{AC^0}(C,A)\\to B,\\quad\n\\operatorname{fill}_{AC^0}(B\\to C,A)=B\\to\\operatorname{fill}_{AC^0}(C,A),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{fill}_{AC^0}\\!\\left(\\bigwedge(B_0,\\ldots,C,\\ldots,B_{m-1}),A\\right)=\n\\bigwedge(B_0,\\ldots,\\operatorname{fill}_{AC^0}(C,A),\\ldots,B_{m-1}),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{fill}_{AC^0}\\!\\left(\\bigwedge(B_0,\\ldots,C,\\ldots,B_{m-1}),A\\right)=\n\\bigwedge(B_0,\\ldots,\\operatorname{fill}_{AC^0}(C,A),\\ldots,B_{m-1}),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{fill}_{AC^0}\\!\\left(\\bigvee(B_0,\\ldots,C,\\ldots,B_{m-1}),A\\right)=\n\\bigvee(B_0,\\ldots,\\operatorname{fill}_{AC^0}(C,A),\\ldots,B_{m-1}).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{fill}_{AC^0}\\!\\left(\\bigvee(B_0,\\ldots,C,\\ldots,B_{m-1}),A\\right)=\n\\bigvee(B_0,\\ldots,\\operatorname{fill}_{AC^0}(C,A),\\ldots,B_{m-1}).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>记号 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C[A]\">\\(C[A]\\)</span> 表示 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{fill}_{AC^0}(C,A)\">\\(\\operatorname{fill}_{AC^0}(C,A)\\)</span>。</p>\n<h1 id=\"4.-公理族\">4. 公理族</h1>\n<p>布尔核心公理为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\mathsf{Hilb}}=\n\\{\\,A\\to(B\\to A),\\ (A\\to(B\\to C))\\to((A\\to B)\\to(A\\to C)),\\ ((A\\to\\bot)\\to(B\\to\\bot))\\to(B\\to A)\\mid A,B,C\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{AC^0}\\,\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\mathsf{Hilb}}=\n\\{\\,A\\to(B\\to A),\\ (A\\to(B\\to C))\\to((A\\to B)\\to(A\\to C)),\\ ((A\\to\\bot)\\to(B\\to\\bot))\\to(B\\to A)\\mid A,B,C\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{AC^0}\\,\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>无界合取门公理为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\land E}=\n\\{\\,\\bigwedge_{j&lt;m}A_j\\to A_k\\mid m\\ge1,\\ k&lt;m,\\ A_j\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{AC^0}\\,\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\land E}=\n\\{\\,\\bigwedge_{j&lt;m}A_j\\to A_k\\mid m\\ge1,\\ k&lt;m,\\ A_j\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{AC^0}\\,\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\land I}=\n\\{\\,A_0\\to(A_1\\to\\cdots(A_{m-1}\\to\\bigwedge_{j&lt;m}A_j)\\cdots)\\mid m\\ge1,\\ A_j\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{AC^0}\\,\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\land I}=\n\\{\\,A_0\\to(A_1\\to\\cdots(A_{m-1}\\to\\bigwedge_{j&lt;m}A_j)\\cdots)\\mid m\\ge1,\\ A_j\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{AC^0}\\,\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>无界析取门公理为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\lor I}=\n\\{\\,A_k\\to\\bigvee_{j&lt;m}A_j\\mid m\\ge1,\\ k&lt;m,\\ A_j\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{AC^0}\\,\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\lor I}=\n\\{\\,A_k\\to\\bigvee_{j&lt;m}A_j\\mid m\\ge1,\\ k&lt;m,\\ A_j\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{AC^0}\\,\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\lor E}=\n\\{\\, (A_0\\to B)\\to\\cdots\\to((A_{m-1}\\to B)\\to(\\bigvee_{j&lt;m}A_j\\to B))\\mid m\\ge1,\\ A_j,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{AC^0}\\,\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\lor E}=\n\\{\\, (A_0\\to B)\\to\\cdots\\to((A_{m-1}\\to B)\\to(\\bigvee_{j&lt;m}A_j\\to B))\\mid m\\ge1,\\ A_j,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{AC^0}\\,\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>总公理集为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{AC^0F}=\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\mathsf{Hilb}}\\cup\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\land E}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\land I}\\cup\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\lor I}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\lor E}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{AC^0F}=\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\mathsf{Hilb}}\\cup\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\land E}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\land I}\\cup\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\lor I}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\lor E}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"5.-规则关系\">5. 规则关系</h1>\n<p>三条规则显示为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\frac{A\\qquad A\\to B}{B},\n\\qquad\n\\frac{A}{\\widehat\\sigma(A)},\n\\qquad\n\\frac{A\\leftrightarrow B}{C[A]\\leftrightarrow C[B]}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\frac{A\\qquad A\\to B}{B},\n\\qquad\n\\frac{A}{\\widehat\\sigma(A)},\n\\qquad\n\\frac{A\\leftrightarrow B}{C[A]\\leftrightarrow C[B]}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\mathsf{MP}}=\n\\{\\,((A,A\\to B),B)\\mid A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{AC^0}\\,\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\mathsf{MP}}=\n\\{\\,((A,A\\to B),B)\\mid A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{AC^0}\\,\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\mathsf{Sub}}=\n\\{\\,((A),\\widehat\\sigma(A))\\mid A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{AC^0},\\ \\sigma:\\mathsf{PVar}\\to\\mathsf{Frm}_{AC^0}\\,\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\mathsf{Sub}}=\n\\{\\,((A),\\widehat\\sigma(A))\\mid A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{AC^0},\\ \\sigma:\\mathsf{PVar}\\to\\mathsf{Frm}_{AC^0}\\,\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>上下文替换规则为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\mathsf{Ctx}}=\n\\{\\,((A\\leftrightarrow B),C[A]\\leftrightarrow C[B])\\mid A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{AC^0},\\ C\\in\\mathsf{Ctx}_{AC^0}\\,\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\mathsf{Ctx}}=\n\\{\\,((A\\leftrightarrow B),C[A]\\leftrightarrow C[B])\\mid A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{AC^0},\\ C\\in\\mathsf{Ctx}_{AC^0}\\,\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"6.-证明对象\">6. 证明对象</h1>\n<p>定义</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Proof}_{AC^0F}(\\Gamma,d,\\pi,A)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Proof}_{AC^0F}(\\Gamma,d,\\pi,A)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>当且仅当 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\\subseteq\\mathsf{Frm}_{AC^0}\">\\(\\Gamma\\subseteq\\mathsf{Frm}_{AC^0}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"d\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(d\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\pi=(A_0,\\ldots,A_{n-1})\">\\(\\pi=(A_0,\\ldots,A_{n-1})\\)</span> 是有限非空公式列、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A_{n-1}=A\">\\(A_{n-1}=A\\)</span>，并且对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"j&lt;n\">\\(j&lt;n\\)</span> 满足</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"A_j\\in\\mathsf{AC^0Line}_d.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[A_j\\in\\mathsf{AC^0Line}_d.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>每一行还必须满足以下五种情形之一：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A_j\\in\\Gamma\">\\(A_j\\in\\Gamma\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A_j\\in\\mathsf{Ax}_{AC^0F}\">\\(A_j\\in\\mathsf{Ax}_{AC^0F}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>存在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"r,s&lt;j\">\\(r,s&lt;j\\)</span> 使 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"((A_r,A_s),A_j)\\in\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\mathsf{MP}}\">\\(((A_r,A_s),A_j)\\in\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\mathsf{MP}}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>存在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"r&lt;j\">\\(r&lt;j\\)</span> 使 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"((A_r),A_j)\\in\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\mathsf{Sub}}\">\\(((A_r),A_j)\\in\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\mathsf{Sub}}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>存在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"r&lt;j\">\\(r&lt;j\\)</span> 使 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"((A_r),A_j)\\in\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\mathsf{Ctx}}\">\\(((A_r),A_j)\\in\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\mathsf{Ctx}}\\)</span>。</li>\n</ol>\n<h1 id=\"7.-可导性\">7. 可导性</h1>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\\vdash_{AC^0F}A\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\exists d\\in\\mathbb N\\,\\exists\\pi\\,\n\\operatorname{Proof}_{AC^0F}(\\Gamma,d,\\pi,A).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\Gamma\\vdash_{AC^0F}A\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\exists d\\in\\mathbb N\\,\\exists\\pi\\,\n\\operatorname{Proof}_{AC^0F}(\\Gamma,d,\\pi,A).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"8.-目标差异\">8. 目标差异</h1>\n<p>定义</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{LineOK}_{AC^0}(d,A)\n\\Longleftrightarrow\nd\\in\\mathbb N\\land A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{AC^0}\\land\\operatorname{depth}(A)\\le d.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{LineOK}_{AC^0}(d,A)\n\\Longleftrightarrow\nd\\in\\mathbb N\\land A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{AC^0}\\land\\operatorname{depth}(A)\\le d.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{and}_m,\\operatorname{or}_m\">\\(\\operatorname{and}_m,\\operatorname{or}_m\\)</span> 对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"m\\ge1\">\\(m\\ge1\\)</span> 都是原始构造子，而单个证明由一个共同常数 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"d\">\\(d\\)</span> 约束全部行；这两条共同给出本系统的目标差异。</p>\n<h1 id=\"9.-形式系统\">9. 形式系统</h1>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal S_{AC^0F}=(\\mathsf{PVar},\\mathsf{Gate}_{AC^0},\\mathsf{Frm}_{AC^0},\\operatorname{arity}_{AC^0},\\operatorname{size},\\operatorname{depth},(\\mathsf{AC^0Line}_d)_{d\\in\\mathbb N},\\operatorname{LineOK}_{AC^0},\\mathrm{FV},\\operatorname{BV}_{AC^0},\\operatorname{Sub}_{AC^0},\\operatorname{FreeRen}_{AC^0},\\operatorname{BoundRen}_{AC^0},\\equiv_{\\alpha,AC^0},\\mathsf{Ctx}_{AC^0},\\operatorname{fill}_{AC^0},\\mathsf{Ax}_{AC^0F},\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\mathsf{MP}},\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\mathsf{Sub}},\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\mathsf{Ctx}},\\operatorname{Proof}_{AC^0F},\\vdash_{AC^0F}).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathcal S_{AC^0F}=(\\mathsf{PVar},\\mathsf{Gate}_{AC^0},\\mathsf{Frm}_{AC^0},\\operatorname{arity}_{AC^0},\\operatorname{size},\\operatorname{depth},(\\mathsf{AC^0Line}_d)_{d\\in\\mathbb N},\\operatorname{LineOK}_{AC^0},\\mathrm{FV},\\operatorname{BV}_{AC^0},\\operatorname{Sub}_{AC^0},\\operatorname{FreeRen}_{AC^0},\\operatorname{BoundRen}_{AC^0},\\equiv_{\\alpha,AC^0},\\mathsf{Ctx}_{AC^0},\\operatorname{fill}_{AC^0},\\mathsf{Ax}_{AC^0F},\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\mathsf{MP}},\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\mathsf{Sub}},\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\mathsf{Ctx}},\\operatorname{Proof}_{AC^0F},\\vdash_{AC^0F}).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>该系统只定义无界扇入常深度 Frege 证明的语法、规则和证明关系；不包含语义载体、真值赋值、满足关系、有效性、语义后承、下界结果或复杂度定理。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"172.-$AC^0$-Frege-系统","text":"172. $AC^0$-Frege 系统","level":1},{"id":"1.-原始符号","text":"1. 原始符号","level":1},{"id":"2.-公式、大小与深度","text":"2. 公式、大小与深度","level":1},{"id":"3.-变量、代换与上下文","text":"3. 变量、代换与上下文","level":1},{"id":"4.-公理族","text":"4. 公理族","level":1},{"id":"5.-规则关系","text":"5. 规则关系","level":1},{"id":"6.-证明对象","text":"6. 证明对象","level":1},{"id":"7.-可导性","text":"7. 可导性","level":1},{"id":"8.-目标差异","text":"8. 目标差异","level":1},{"id":"9.-形式系统","text":"9. 形式系统","level":1}],"links":[],"math":[{"tex":"AC^0","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf{PVar}=\\{p_0,p_1,\\ldots\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf{Gate}_{AC^0}\n=\n\\{\\top,\\bot,\\operatorname{var},\\operatorname{neg},\\operatorname{imp}\\}\n\\cup\\{\\operatorname{and}_m,\\operatorname{or}_m:m\\ge1\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"AC^0","display":false},{"tex":"\\top,\\bot,\\operatorname{var},\\operatorname{neg},\\operatorname{imp},\n\\operatorname{and}_m,\\operatorname{or}_m\\quad(m\\ge1).","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{and}_m","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{or}_m","display":false},{"tex":"m","display":false},{"tex":"\\neg A","display":false},{"tex":"A\\to B","display":false},{"tex":"\\bigwedge_{j<m}A_j","display":false},{"tex":"\\bigvee_{j<m}A_j","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{arity}_{AC^0}:\\mathsf{Gate}_{AC^0}\\to\\mathbb N,","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{arity}_{AC^0}(\\top)=\\operatorname{arity}_{AC^0}(\\bot)=0,\\quad\n\\operatorname{arity}_{AC^0}(\\operatorname{var})=1,","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{arity}_{AC^0}(\\operatorname{neg})=1,\\quad\n\\operatorname{arity}_{AC^0}(\\operatorname{imp})=2,\\quad\n\\operatorname{arity}_{AC^0}(\\operatorname{and}_m)=\n\\operatorname{arity}_{AC^0}(\\operatorname{or}_m)=m.","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathsf{Frm}_{AC^0}","display":false},{"tex":"\\top,\\b